  (letmut status :i64 (main-built paths path mqual sbase scount sftys ewords dsig dcnt dret sigtys fint fret fbase fcnt fparam fpc ptys bbase bcnt bterm bty bhas ops t1 t2 t3 n1 sst scn tst tcn tvals tags elem extra pbase tptypes pchild mtriple snames enames gnames gdata dnames fnames fsyms pnames blabels bv1 bv2 bv3 dests sa sb sc sd svals tnames powner tpnames pvname nod ntx out defs mods kinds texts lines cols))
